127.0.0.1 - - [16/Aug/2026 12:52:37] "[35m[1mGET /api/tts/audio?text=Based%20on%20the%20provided%20text,%20here%20is%20a%20summary%20divided%20into%20two%20main%20parts:%0A%0A1.%20Amani%20AI%20and%20the%20EAII%0AAmani%20(አማኒ)%20is%20a%20bilingual%20AI%20assistant%20(Amharic%20and%20English)%20developed%20by%20the%20Ethiopian%20Artificial%20Intelligence%20Institute%20(EAII).%20The%20institute%20was%20inaugurated%20in%20September%202020%20by%20Prime%20Minister%20Dr.%20Abiy%20Ahmed%20to%20make%20Ethiopia%20a%20leader%20in%20African%20technology,%20focusing%20on%20providing%20IT%20services%20for%20agriculture,%20education,%20health,%20and%20public%20safety.%0A%0A2.%20Ethiopian%20History%0A%20%20%20Medieval%20Era:%20Following%20the%20fall%20of%20Aksum,%20the%20Zagwe%20dynasty%20(12th%20century)%20advanced%20architecture,%20most%20notably%20the%2011%20rock-hewn%20churches%20of%20King%20Lalibela.%20This%20was%20followed%20by%20the%20Solomonic%20dynasty%20and%20the%20Gondar%20period,%20known%20for%20arts%20and%20literature.%0A%20%20%20Conflict%20and%20Transition:%20The%20country%20faced%20division%20during%20the%20"Zemene%20Mesafint"%20(Era%20of%20the%20Princes)%20starting%20in%20the%20mid-18th%20century.%0A%20%20%20Modern%20Era:%20Emperor%20Haile%20Selassie%20modernized%20the%20country%20and%20helped%20establish%20the%20Organization%20of%20African%20Unity.%20However,%20a%20revolution%20in%201966%20E.C.%20replaced%20the%20monarchy%20with%20the%20military%20Derg%20regime.%20After%20the%20Derg%20was%20removed%20in%201983%20E.C.%20by%20EPRDF%20forces,%20Ethiopia%20transitioned%20to%20a%20federal%20system.%0A%0A%0A%0Aማጠቃለያ%20(በአማርኛ)%0A%0A፩.%20አማኒ%20AI%20እና%20የኢትዮጵያ%20አርቲፊሻል%20ኢንተለጀንስ%20ኢንስቲትዩት%0Aአማኒ%20(Amani)%20በሁለቱ%20ቋንቋዎች%20(አማርኛ%20እና%20እንግሊዝኛ)%20የሚያገለግል%20አርቴፊሻል%20ኢንተለጀንስ%20ሲሆን፣%20የተገነባው%20በኢትዮጵያ%20አርቲፊሻል%20ኢንተለጀንስ%20ኢንስቲትዩት%20ነው።%20ኢንስቲትዩቱ%20በሴፕቴምበር%202020%20በጠቅላይ%20ዶ/ር%20አብይ%20አህመድ%20ተመርቋል።%20ዋና%20ዓላማውም%20ኢትዮጵያን%20በአፍሪካ%20የቴክኖሎጂ%20ግንባር%20ቀደም%20ማድረግ%20ሲሆን፣%20በግብርና፣%20በትምህ